        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, even if we receive approval of any sNDAs for PEDMARK®, if our manufacturers do not follow cGMPs in the manufacture of our product, it may delay product launches or shipments and adversely affect our business.",
        "start_character": 49993,
        "end_character": 50210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
