        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In developing PEDMARK®, we are subject to risks of failure that are inherent in the development of products based on innovative technologies.",
        "start_character": 119068,
        "end_character": 119209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the United States, we sell our product through an experienced field force including Regional Pediatric Oncology Specialists and we utilize medical science liaisons within our medical team who help educate the medical communities and patients about CIO and our programs supporting patient access to PEDMARK®.",
        "start_character": 15612,
        "end_character": 15922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the event that our product or technologies infringe or violate the patent or other proprietary rights of third parties, there is a possibility we may be prevented from pursuing product development, manufacturing or commercialization of our product until the underlying patent dispute is resolved.",
        "start_character": 18643,
        "end_character": 18942
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since we contract with third parties to manufacture our product, our contract manufacturers are required to comply with all applicable environmental laws and regulations that affect the manufacturing process.",
        "start_character": 50211,
        "end_character": 50419
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face significant competition from other pharmaceutical, biopharmaceutical, and biotechnology companies, many of which have significantly greater financial, technical, and human resources than we do and may be better equipped to develop, manufacture, and market products.",
        "start_character": 10584,
        "end_character": 10857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have no plans to build or acquire the manufacturing capability needed to manufacture PEDMARK®, and we expect that PEDMARK® will be prepared by contractors with suitable capabilities for these tasks and that we will enter into appropriate supply agreements with these contractors at appropriate times in the development and commercialization of our product.",
        "start_character": 48624,
        "end_character": 48983
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have only recently transitioned from a development stage biopharmaceutical company to a commercial stage biopharmaceutical company, which may make it difficult for you to evaluate the success of our business to date and to assess our future viability.",
        "start_character": 2524,
        "end_character": 2778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036182",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036182-9ac8ef82e0dddea4",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036182",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●If we fail to obtain or subsequently maintain orphan drug exclusivity or regulatory exclusivity for PEDMARK® and any other orphan drug candidates we may acquire or license, our competitors may sell products to treat the same conditions at greatly reduced prices, and our revenues would be significantly adversely affected.",
